# Things in my project that must never reach GitHub.
#
# Lives here rather than in the repo's root .gitignore so my project keeps
# its own housekeeping to itself. Git reads a .gitignore in any directory
# and applies it to everything beneath, so these paths are relative to this
# folder.

# My Anthropic API key.
documented-answers/mockup/.env

# Documented's article text, pulled from documentedny.com. Theirs, not mine
# to republish. The deployed app gets it as a Secret File instead.
documented-answers/mockup/corpus.json

# Written at runtime: the daily message counter and the usage/cost record.
documented-answers/mockup/.daily-count
documented-answers/mockup/.usage.json
